# NOTE: internal/analysis/regression_test.go was listed here and deleted in the
# same change. That combination removed the only end-to-end regression suite AND
# made re-adding it impossible without editing this file first. Restored; do not
# re-ignore source or test files here -- this list is for build outputs.

# Per-machine environment notes: sample binary paths, env var exports, memory
# limits. The same role as a .env -- AGENTS.md is the shared contract, this is
# one developer's local setup and is meaningless (and wrong) on another machine.
AGENTS-local.md

# Golden test records under internal/analysis/testdata/golden/ are COMMITTED,
# deliberately. They used to be ignored on the grounds of being per-machine,
# but they are not: each record carries the input binary's SHA-256, and the
# test skips when the local sample does not match it. Ignoring them made the
# gate unable to fail — with no record on disk the test recorded one and
# passed, so a fresh clone or CI run always went green no matter what the
# pipeline produced.

